  of dcUnbreakable, dcUseEffects, dcMinimumAttackCharge, dcDamageType, dcLore, dcRarity, dcTooltipDisplay, dcRepairCost, dcCreativeSlotLock, dcEnchantmentGlintOverride, dcIntangibleProjectile, dcUseRemainder, dcAttackRange, dcRepairable, dcGlider, dcDeathProtection, dcBlocksAttacks, dcPiercingWeapon, dcKineticWeapon, dcSwingAnimation, dcAdditionalTradeCost, dcDye, dcMapColor, dcMapDecorations, dcMapPostProcessing, dcPotionDurationScale, dcSuspiciousStewEffects, dcDebugStickState, dcEntityData, dcBucketEntityData, dcInstrument, dcProvidesTrimMaterial, dcProvidesBannerPatterns, dcRecipes, dcBannerPatterns, dcPotDecorations, dcBees, dcSulfurCubeContent, dcBreakSound:
